    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x1e106d
    RemappedName:       D3DOGL_0x1e106d
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "Set Occupancy fields in the QMD to program the Low Occupancy Watermark for resources specific to async queue RT (non-BVH) dispatches.  GA10x+ SMSCC feature. See http://nvbugs/2509750 for further details and FD link.  Regkey has 8 bits each for warp threshold, RF threshold, and ShM threshold respectively (ShM being the LSB).  Clamped to 128 by HW"
    Default:    0x104000
END_KEY

BEGIN_KEY  QMD_OCC_MAX_SYNC
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x1e106e
    RemappedName:       D3DOGL_0x1e106e
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "Set Occupancy fields in the QMD to program the High Occupancy Watermark for resources specific to sync queue dispatches.  GA10x+ SMSCC feature. See http://nvbugs/2509750 for further details and FD link.  Regkey has 8 bits each for warp threshold, RF threshold, and ShM threshold respectively (ShM being the LSB).  Clamped to 128 by HW"
    Default:    0xFFFFFF
END_KEY

BEGIN_KEY  QMD_OCC_MAX_ASYNC
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x1e1070
    RemappedName:       D3DOGL_0x1e1070
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "Set Occupancy fields in the QMD to program the High Occupancy Watermark for resources specific to async queue dispatches. GA10x+ SMSCC feature. See http://nvbugs/2509750 for further details and FD link. Regkey has 8 bits each for warp threshold, RF threshold, and ShM threshold respectively (ShM being the LSB). Clamped to 128 by HW"
