    BinaryID:           0x1a1042
    RemappedName:       D3DOGL_0x1a1042
    Type:               bool
    Documentation:      "Allows CWD to launch all compute work from async queue. Default is OFF.  GA10x+ SMSCC feature. See http://nvbugs/2509750 for further details and FD link. Overrides default regkeys set for sync/async compute work"
