    RemappedName:       D3D_0x674b85
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "Set custom key for triggering RTCore profile write. Also need to set RTCORE_BVH_DUMP_MODE to HOTKEY. (default is ctrl+pageup)"
    Default:            0x21        // VK_PRIOR (pageup)
